  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HRFT-Rehabilitation of Torture Survivors, prevention of torture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is in the form of continuation of a previous grant given to HRFT from 2013 to 2020. The HRFT gives treatment and rehabilitation to torture survivors and their families. They will expand their rehabilitation services across Turkey and make it easier for torture survivors who are living in the cities where there is no HRFT.</narrative>
  </description>
